# Payment Lookup by ID Number - API Documentation

## Endpoint

```
POST https://api.paynala.com/functions/v1/lookup-payment
```

## Authentication

Include your merchant API key in the request header:

```
x-api-key: your-merchant-api-key
```

## Request

**Headers:**
```
Content-Type: application/json
x-api-key: f5d929362e75b0caba644a9237150ae1c4cbb9efaefe5471e8fe66d4ca2d9dd7
```

**Body:**
```json
{
  "id_number": "AB123456"
}
```

| Field | Type | Required | Description |
|-------|------|----------|-------------|
| `id_number` | string | Yes | The ID number to search (passport, national ID, etc.) |

